  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table shows the aetiology of genital ulcer disease (GUD) among patients at a gold mine STI clinic in South Africa in 1986, 1990, 1994 and 1998, as numbers with percentage distribution. Rows give single aetiologies (chancroid, LGV, genital herpes, RPR positive), mixed infections, their totals and indeterminate cases.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
